spell_flavour_text = "Let them look. Light finds its way around obstacles. So does he."
theory_desc = "Wave diffraction — waves bend around obstacles and spread into shadow regions. Caster wraps their mana signature in a diffraction pattern, causing detection spells and targeted projectiles to bend around them. Not full invisibility — breaks immediately on offensive cast.
Synergy: Diffraction Veil → Resonance Crack. Veil buys the cast time window; opponent cannot target-lock during the tune phase."
